                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thrust; a push; a sudden force that impels."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4b0cf61-ae55-4e7d-9470-3fa3707e7667",
                                                "sense_id": "736b795a-8a95-3654-bb37-ba7ac8ec7e79",
                                                "text": "c. 1715-1716, Samuel Clarke, letter to Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz\nAll spontaneous animal motion is performed by mechanical impulse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32633198-4b13-3a4a-89d1-7a20e2542807",
                                        "entry_id": "9332e134-dec3-3c3a-bc47-330b7e5019ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wish or urge, particularly a sudden one prompting action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "602db2cb-712a-4a00-9132-2597aabb2227",
                                                "sense_id": "32633198-4b13-3a4a-89d1-7a20e2542807",
                                                "text": "The impulse to learn drove me to study night and day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc62b84a-3004-443d-8d0f-19072858792d",
                                                "sense_id": "32633198-4b13-3a4a-89d1-7a20e2542807",
                                                "text": "When I saw the new book, I couldn't resist the impulse to browse through it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a93f124-4cae-46c3-b7a8-ef93ebc5c2a6",
                                                "sense_id": "32633198-4b13-3a4a-89d1-7a20e2542807",
                                                "text": "Theſe were my natural Impulses for the undertaking: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "861e2f59-634f-4289-8880-ea1aa338353f",
                                                "sense_id": "32633198-4b13-3a4a-89d1-7a20e2542807",
                                                "text": "Tony's face expressed relief, and Nettie sat silent for a moment until the vicar said “It was a generous impulse, but it may have been a momentary one,[…].”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f2e2136-a255-4859-942c-24b8929d59d8",
                                                "sense_id": "32633198-4b13-3a4a-89d1-7a20e2542807",
                                                "text": "An impulse urged him to plant a sudden blow on it, by he forced himself to consider the impolicy of such an act."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8200145d-7899-32f6-9f7c-40b0b606b32c",
                                        "entry_id": "9332e134-dec3-3c3a-bc47-330b7e5019ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The integral of force over time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "253213cb-9fd3-4be4-852b-f6af09532489",
                                                "sense_id": "8200145d-7899-32f6-9f7c-40b0b606b32c",
                                                "text": "The total impulse from the impact will depend on the kinetic energy of the projectile."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
